{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>You guided in Your kindness.</b> By way of the Midrash: in the merit of three things they were redeemed — in the merit of deeds of lovingkindness, in the merit of Torah, and in the merit of the sacrifices, etc. 'In Your kindness' — this is deeds of lovingkindness. And all three of them Scripture mentioned, as it says (Deuteronomy 30:14): ״כי קרוב אליך הדבר מאד בפיך ובלבבך לעשותו״ — 'in your mouth' — this is Torah; 'and in your heart' — this is worship (avodah), as it is written (Deuteronomy 11:13): ״ולעבדו בכל לבבכם״; 'to do it' — this is deeds of lovingkindness."], :book :exodus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:59:32.316770418Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}